{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Simulator is a cozy farming simulator with a focus on the fast &quot;plant-grow-sell&quot; cycle. Start with a tiny plot and gradually expand your farm, unlocking new fields. Buy seeds, feed, and tools at the local market: plant crops in beds using a convenient context menu, monitor the growth stages, and harvest. Sell your produce at the market stand to earn coins and experience, then unlock more rows of land and upgrades.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045970?t=1759161079","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045970?t=1759161079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045970/c62962874a70fb8e4e3fbca550dc86b7b862cb15/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759161079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045970/c62962874a70fb8e4e3fbca550dc86b7b862cb15/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759161079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farm Simulator is a cozy farming simulator with a focus on the fast &quot;plant-grow-sell&quot; cycle. Start with a tiny plot and gradually expand your farm, unlocking new fields. Buy seeds, feed, and tools at the local market: plant crops in beds using a convenient context menu, monitor the growth stages, and harvest. Sell your produce at the market stand to earn coins and experience, then unlock more rows of land and upgrades.</p>","developers":["B.B.B.Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045970/0b0a033b0d492afe58f58c19cb971b789f6d4266/header.jpg?t=175